    modified_response: "I have successfully built and deployed a premium, full-stack web application for **GYDEN Real Estate Group (GREC)** to replace your Netlify draft with a fully functional, interactive ecosystem. \n\nYour application compiles successfully and is live in your preview container. Because I have set up our recommended server-side structure, any Gemini API requests operate securely in the background, keeping credentials hidden from the browser. You can view or configure your API key anytime in the **Settings > Secrets** panel in your Google AI Studio workspace.\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Design & Aesthetic Style\n* **Charcoal & Bronze Elegance**: Employs a dark-mode canvas styled with warm off-white typography, ambient highlights, and premium bronze/amber accents.\n* **Proportional Padding**: Promotes readability using generous negative spacing, dividing major asset tools into a single-scroll presentation with clean layout transitions.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\222\273 Implemented Features & Modules\n\n1. **Executive Desk Indicator & Header**\n   * Features high-contrast navigation hooks, real-time Johor Bahru RTS corridor growth metrics, and direct client actions.\n\n2. **Cumulative Investment Strategy Simulator**\n   * **Financial Engineering Lab**: An interactive compounding yield simulator allowing you to input principal property funds (RM), monthly corporate supplements, duration (years), and target gains.\n   * **Compound Projection Timeline**: Dynamically computes annual growth ratios and lists them in a scannable ledger, separating rental yield and capital appreciation curves in real-time.\n\n3. **Gyden Signature Asset Allocation Matrix**\n   * **Strategic Sliders**: Move slider knobs to allocate portfolio percentages among *Core Commercial Yield Assets*, *Landed Freehold Residential Villas*, *Transit Corridor Joint-Ventures*, and *Cash Reserves*.\n   * **Calculated Balances**: Computes direct valuation splits dynamically linked to your principal funds and highlights CEO Gyden Heng\'s signature allocation template when balanced (50/30/10/10).\n\n4. **Internal Property & Legal Document Database (PREVIEW)**\n   * **The Property Registry**: Highlighting **SA001 (Danga Bay Commercial Hub)**, **SA002 (Skudai Luxury Villa)**, and **SA003 (JB Central Office Plot)** with custom areas, price models, and yields.\n   * **Integrated Legal Document Vault**: Clicking on any property mounts its workspace, enabling you to inspect its confidential internal files\342\200\224such as *Investment Brochures*, *Architectural Floor Plans*, *Draft Tenancy Agreements*, and *RTS Feasibility Audits*\342\200\224directly in an inline document console.\n\n5. **Interactive Gemini AI Advisor**\n   * **Google Gemini Integration**: Built an active server-side chat interface using the modern `@google/genai` library and `gemini-3.5-flash` model.\n   * **Informed Assistant**: The advisor is trained directly on GYDEN\342\200\231s Johore property specifications, transit routes, and allocation parameters to consult clients intelligently. Includes query shortcuts to auto-fill investment questions.\n\n6. **Strategic Intake Questionnaire (Contact Form)**\n   * A clean corporate consultation portal that captures name, secure emails, target strategies, and custom investor notes, submitting them to the server to issue a secure **Dossier Reference ID**.\n"
